 ggml/src/ggml-backend.cpp      |  24 +++++
 ggml/src/ggml-rpc/ggml-rpc.cpp | 176 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 2 files changed, 188 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

